.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-singleton-release 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-singleton\-release \- Drop a task\*(Aqs lock, which its exit trap does and a kill cannot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten singleton release\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItask\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Drop a task\*(Aqs lock, which its exit trap does and a kill cannot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItask\fR>
The task\*(Aqs name, which is what the lock is keyed by
